==Restrictions==
Rarity: Only [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare]] and [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[Heavenly Herald Papuu]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 34.67~37.33 seconds<sup>1,040f~1,120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Wall Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 46.67~49.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,480f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Rel]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 14.67~17.33 seconds<sup>440f~520f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 116.67 seconds<sup>3,500f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 156.67 seconds<sup>4,700f</sup>, delay 14.67~17.33 seconds<sup>440f~520f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 203.33 seconds<sup>6,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
While the restriction keeps you from using your Ubers and Special Cats, you still have access to useful [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rares]] and [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rares]] such as [[Bakery Cat (Rare Cat)|Fried Chicken Cat]], [[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Cafeteria Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and such. The strategy is otherwise similar to [[Saintly Sister (Merciless)|Saintly Sister]].

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Cafeteria Cat]] - Can deal high Single Target damage to Papuu and can also help with the peons in this stage due to his decent generalist damage.
*[[Bakery Cat (Rare Cat)|Boomerang/Fried Chicken Cat]] - Can be used to permanently curse Papuu if timed right. Both forms work the exact same in terms of the curse ability, but his true form provides a strong health boost, which can help handle the strict timing.
*[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] - Although he's only viable with his true form, he can deal high amounts of damage to almost every enemy in the field and bring any Sir Rels hit by the [[Wave Attack]] at a low enough health for another unit to kill. Do note that Papuu herself is immune to Waves, however.
*[[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] - Can deal high amounts of damage to Papuu and the other peons in this  stage.
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] - Similar to Can Can Cat, but has a higher attack rate damage and Area Attack to deal with all the smaller peons and chip the stronger peons.
*[[Vega Cat (Rare Cat)|Vega Cat]]: With a restriction in place, Vega's role as a anti-Angel Toxic Immune meatshield becomes invaluable here, as now that Riceball is gone, he becomes one of the very few Toxic Immune meatshields accessible for this stage!

==Trivia==
*Divine Daughter's Japanese name, Seinto★Oneesan (聖★おねえさん, "Saintly★Elder Sister"), is nearly identical to [[Saintly Sister (Merciless)|Saintly Sister]]'s Japanese name, with the only difference being the addition of a star. The star makes it even more of a reference to the manga ''[[wikipedia:Saint Young Men|Saint Young Men]]'' (聖☆おにいさん ''Seinto☆Oniisan'') and "[https://youtu.be/GodqyOjwmtg Saint☆Ojisan]" (聖☆おじさん ''Seinto☆Ojisan''), the [[wikipedia:Denki Groove|Denki Groove]] and [[wikipedia:Scha Dara Parr|Scha Dara Purr]] song that inspired said manga.

